# Mesa, arch x86_64
### The gallium drivers of the PC: Intel (iris from Gen8, crocus before it) and AMD (radeonsi, r600,
### with the AMDGPU backend of lfs/llvm), besides the ones of every machine. The Vulkan drivers are
### auto: amd, intel, intel_hasvk, nouveau, swrast on x86_64
MESA_GALLIUM_DRIVERS="nouveau,svga,virgl,softpipe,llvmpipe,zink"
MESA_GALLIUM_DRIVERS+=",iris,crocus,radeonsi,r600"
